# Secrets
**/.env*
!**/.env.spec
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# next/Dockerfile promotes .env.ci-build.<NEXT_BUILD_ENV> to .env.production.local
# during the build, so the sources must reach the context.
!next/.env.ci-build.*
